  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH plugin ecosystem added 56 new plugins (18,205 total) and 334 stars on the official repo, with dataelement/dsh-desktop leading growth at +104 stars as the official dsh 0.2.1-alpha.1 shipped. However, 14,418 of 17,942 non-fork plugins have been stale for over 7 days, giving a health score of 38 and suggesting attention is concentrated in a few projects.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>56</b> 个插件，总量达 <b>18205</b> 个，官方仓库星标涨了 <b>334</b>；增长榜上 dataelement/dsh-desktop 单日 +<b>104</b> 星领跑，官方也放出了 dsh <b>0.2.1-alpha.1</b>。不过 <b>17942</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>14418</b> 个超过 7 天没动静，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，热度集中在少数项目，建议持续观察。"
